    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5148" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμεμφ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>freedom from blame,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαλλακτῆρι δ᾽ οὐκ ἀ. φίλοις</span>
			mediator has no <i>freedom from blame</i> on the part of his
			friends, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				909
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμεμφίας χάριν</span> for
				<i>avoidance of censure,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				283
			</span></i>. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμεμφεία</span> shd. perh. be
			written in both passages.)</div>
